# REPRO : build_molinv S4-cache MPI deadlock on per-rank atom->nmax growth.
#
# Mechanism under test: reallocate_storage() is triggered by `atom->nmax > nmax`,
# a PER-RANK condition. deallocate_storage() clears molinv_valid and nulls
# molinv/mol2c on that rank alone; the earlier build_molinv gate then split ranks
# between the collective rebuild and the cache-hit path -> mismatched collectives,
# permanent silent hang.
#
# Trigger construction (np2, processors 2 1 1, split at x = Lx/2):
#   - rank 0 carries a dense SPC-FQ gas block sized so its nlocal+nghost lands
#     JUST UNDER a multiple of AtomVec DELTA = 16384 (nmax granularity);
#   - rank 1 carries a molecule stream with vx < 0, rammed into rank 0's domain;
#   - arrivals push rank 0 past the multiple mid-run WITHOUT changing natoms
#     (so the natoms term of the gate stays true and only the rank-local terms
#     diverge). Rank 0 then regrows/reallocates alone at an exchange step.
#
# PRE-FIX (binary without ): the ranks split at the gate and their next
#   collectives mismatch. Manifestation depends on the MPI/collective pairing:
#   the np4 campaign saw a permanent silent hang (~100% CPU, thermo stops; gdb:
#   a subset of ranks in FixQEqSam::build_molinv -> MPI_Allreduce, the rest past
#   it in the solve); THIS deck at np2/OpenMPI aborts with
#   "An error occurred in MPI_Allreduce ... MPI_ERR_TRUNCATE: message truncated"
#   (build_molinv's 1-tagint rebuild reduce colliding with project_neutral's
#   nmol_+tail-double reduce). Measured 2026-08-08: dies between thermo steps
#   100 and 125, twice, same window -- deterministic. Either signature = FAIL.
# POST-FIX: run completes AND the log contains the one-shot warning
#   "build_molinv cache validity diverged across ranks" -- the warning is the
#   proof that the divergence actually occurred (a completed run WITHOUT the
#   warning means the deck no longer exercises the defect; re-tune vdense).
#
# Tuning: vdense sets the dense-block x-extent (lattice units). Aim rank 0
# nlocal+nghost (log "Nlocal"/"Nghost" max on a `-var nsteps 0` sizing pass)
# 300-1500 BELOW a 16384 multiple. See run_repro.sh.

variable        nsteps index 600    # pre-fix failure fires at ~step 100-125 (6x margin)
variable        vdense index 16.5
variable        px     index 2      # set 1 for the serial control (processors must match np)

units           metal
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
processors      ${px} 1 1
processors      2 1 1
lattice         sc 3.1
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.1 3.1 3.1
region          box block 0 40 0 10 0 10
create_box      2 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (124 31 31)
  2 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
mass            1 15.9994
mass            2 1.008
molecule        h2o spcfq.mol
